},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"config","children":[{"type":"text","value":"config"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EffectConfig"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TRow"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TKey"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"deps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"deps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DependencyList"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function ChatComponent() {\n  useLiveQueryEffect(\n    {\n      query: (q) => q.from({ msg: messages }).where(({ msg }) => eq(msg.role, 'user')),\n      skipInitial: true,\n      onEnter: async (event) => {\n        await generateResponse(event.value)\n      },\n    },\n    []\n  )\n\n  return <div>...</div>\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"trow","text":"TRow","level":3},{"id":"tkey","text":"TKey","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"config","text":"config","level":3},{"id":"deps","text":"deps","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useLiveQueryEffect<TRow, TKey>(config, deps): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useLiveQueryEffect.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/react-db/src/useLiveQueryEffect.ts#L30)\n\nReact hook for creating a reactive effect that fires handlers when rows\nenter, exit, or update within a query result.\n\nThe effect is created on mount and disposed on unmount. If `deps` change,\nthe previous effect is disposed and a new one is created.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TRow\n\n`TRow` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number` = `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### config\n\n`EffectConfig`\\<`TRow`, `TKey`\\>\n\n### deps\n\n`DependencyList` = `[]`\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction ChatComponent() {\n  useLiveQueryEffect(\n    {\n      query: (q) => q.from({ msg: messages }).where(({ msg }) => eq(msg.role, 'user')),\n      skipInitial: true,\n      onEnter: async (event) => {\n        await generateResponse(event.value)\n      },\n    },\n    []\n  )\n\n  return <div>...</div>\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useLiveQueryEffect\ntitle: useLiveQueryEffect\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useLiveQueryEffect<TRow, TKey>(config, deps): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useLiveQueryEffect.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/react-db/src/useLiveQueryEffect.ts#L30)\n\nReact hook for creating a reactive effect that fires handlers when rows\nenter, exit, or update within a query result.\n\nThe effect is created on mount and disposed on unmount. If `deps` change,\nthe previous effect is disposed and a new one is created.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TRow\n\n`TRow` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number` = `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### config\n\n`EffectConfig`\\<`TRow`, `TKey`\\>\n\n### deps\n\n`DependencyList` = `[]`\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction ChatComponent() {\n  useLiveQueryEffect(\n    {\n      query: (q) => q.from({ msg: messages }).where(({ msg }) => eq(msg.role, 'user')),\n      skipInitial: true,\n      onEnter: async (event) => {\n        await generateResponse(event.value)\n      },\n    },\n    []\n  )\n\n  return <div>...</div>\n}\n```\n"}
